<main class="page shell medium prose" id="main"><section class="panel padded"><span class="heading-kicker"><?=e(t('ZAYQAH COMMUNITY'))?></span><h1><?=e(t('Privacy notice — draft'))?></h1><div class="alert"><?=e(t('Draft for owner review before public launch. Replace with your business identity, contact email, retention periods and complete privacy policy.'))?></div><h2><?=e(t('Information used by this platform'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Customer accounts collect full name, date of birth, phone, email, password hash and optional delivery address. Session cookies keep you signed in.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Seller verification'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Seller applications collect business name, address, phone and logo, along with an encrypted CNIC number and private CNIC front/back images. Identity images are only available to the platform administrator for review. Business name, address, logo and approved menu details are publicly visible.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Orders and favourites'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Orders retain contact name, phone, delivery address when applicable, purchased dish names, prices, quantities and fulfillment status. Shops receive the details needed to prepare and fulfill their own orders. Favourite shops and food are saved privately to your account.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Reviews and your cart'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Restaurant reviews display your full name, rating, review text and date publicly. Shop reviews can be updated. Food reviews require a completed order and retain the dish name and seller association even when a dish is removed. Your cart is stored in your browser session and is cleared when you sign out.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Emails and account security'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('We use your email for verification, password resets and seller application decisions. Reset and verification links expire. Security attempt logs support rate limiting.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Retention and contact'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('The owner must publish a retention/deletion policy and a contact channel before accepting real customer or identity data. This starter does not yet provide a self-service data deletion flow.'))?></p></section><section class="panel padded space-top"><h2><?=e(t('Locations, notifications and support'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('We save the address and precise map pin you choose at signup and checkout. Order destination pins are shared with the seller and the rider who holds a seller-issued delivery link. Rider links expire and stop working when the order closes. Riders can deliberately share a single location pin; this feature does not continuously track location.'))?></p><p><?=e(t('Maps use OpenStreetMap tiles, whose provider receives normal map requests. Your address text is not sent for geocoding. Notifications and order tracking are visible only to authorized accounts. Seller feedback about a customer is visible to that seller and customer, not a public profile. Contact requests include the account details shown in the form and are available to platform administrators.'))?></p></section></main><?php require ROOT.'/app/footer.php'; ?>
